Okay, done.

1230
01:12:48.750 --> 01:12:49.200
Done.

1231
01:12:58.620 --> 01:13:01.910
"You are a little crazy. 
I am also a little crazy."

1232
01:13:02.080 --> 01:13:05.290
"There is little 
sorrow in happiness too"

1233
